  "title": "I Never Type Anymore And It Cost Me Nothing",
  "description": "Voicebox is a free open source desktop app that gives you a system-wide dictation hotkey plus local voice cloning and text to speech, all running on your own machine with no cloud and no API key. It replaces roughly $37 a month of Wispr Flow and Eleven Labs subscriptions.\n\nIn this short: how the push-to-talk hotkey works, the local cleanup model that removes filler words and adds punctuation, the real system requirements, and where to download it.\n\nGet the full setup guide here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1qfUwzsB4oT9pWSuzX0vyEl5OnGKXTR2TWPqIGfR86bk/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #AITools #VoiceAI",
